meta {
  name: 06 the default both
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{host}}/_nl
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "prompt": "how many products are out of stock"
  }
}

docs {
  What you get back - the default, both

  Send nothing for "response" and you get both halves:

    "response"  a sentence a person can read, written by the model from what Elasticsearch returned
    "result"    the Elasticsearch response itself

  A chat bot usually wants exactly this: show the sentence, keep the data for the table underneath.
}
